WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Let's plan your first shipment to the United States.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
You'll need a commercial invoice,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
a CUSMA certificate of origin if your goods qualify,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
and a customs broker on the U.S. side.
